MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 MultiVar_TestMultiVar
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

MultiVar_TestMultiVar [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 10

MOVE TEMP 2 20

MOVE TEMP 3 30

MOVE TEMP 4 1

MOVE TEMP 5 0

MOVE TEMP 6 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 11 HALLOCATE  TIMES  PLUS 2 1  4
MOVE TEMP 12 4
L2 CJUMP  LE TEMP 12 MINUS  TIMES  PLUS 2 1  4  1 L3
HSTORE  PLUS TEMP 11 TEMP 12 0  0
MOVE TEMP 12 PLUS TEMP 12 4
JUMP L2
L3 HSTORE TEMP 11 0 2
RETURN TEMP 11
END


MOVE TEMP 7 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 13 HALLOCATE  TIMES  PLUS 3 1  4
MOVE TEMP 14 4
L4 CJUMP  LE TEMP 14 MINUS  TIMES  PLUS 3 1  4  1 L5
HSTORE  PLUS TEMP 13 TEMP 14 0  0
MOVE TEMP 14 PLUS TEMP 14 4
JUMP L4
L5 HSTORE TEMP 13 0 3
RETURN TEMP 13
END


HSTORE PLUS TEMP 6 TIMES 4 0 4 TEMP 1

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 6 TIMES 4 1 4 TEMP 2

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 7 TIMES 4 0 4 TEMP 3

MOVE TEMP 9 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 15 PLUS TEMP 6 TIMES 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 16 TEMP 15 4
RETURN TEMP 16
END


MOVE TEMP 10 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 17 PLUS TEMP 7 TIMES 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 18 TEMP 17 4
RETURN TEMP 18
END


MOVE TEMP 8 PLUS TEMP 9 TEMP 10

PRINT TEMP 8
CJUMP TEMP 4 L7
CJUMP MINUS 1 TEMP 4 L9
 L9 CJUMP TEMP 5 L6
CJUMP MINUS 1 TEMP 5 L7

 
L6 
PRINT 1

 JUMP L8
L7 
PRINT 0


L8 NOOP

RETURN 0
END

